***REMOVED***!/usr/bin/env bash
***REMOVED*** bws-get — get a single SM secret value.
***REMOVED*** Usage: bws-get KEY
***REMOVED*** Reads BWS_ACCESS_TOKEN from env or ~/.config/bitw/config.
